<title>FRANCE: Bongrain nine month sales 7.4 bln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Bongrain nine month sales 7.4 bln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30.</p>
<p>(All figures in billions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					7.4</p>
<p>NOTE - The company gave the results in a statement. It said that on like for like basis, turnover rose 3.6 percent. It said the effect of exchange rates was negligible.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
